                                                "sense_id": "b9d284de-8b89-3610-8843-2f4b1acf53eb",
                                                "text": "After independence, Rhodesia changed its name to Zimbabwe, Nyasaland to Malawi, and Bechuanaland to Botswana."
                                            },
